        label: "CNN + Transfer Learning",
        day: "Mer",
        description: "CNN = state-of-art pour images. Transfer learning (utiliser modèle pré-entraîné) = 99% des cas business. ResNet/EfficientNet = backbones standards. Fine-tune sur ton dataset = top accuracy en heures.",
        url: "https://pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/transfer_learning_tutorial.html",
